ting context switching by embedding autonomous agents into terminal workflow.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">terminal</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • May 23, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://powabase.com\" target=\"_blank\">Powabase</a>\n                        <span class=\"badge\">#1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Backend-as-a-service platform for AI-native applications combining PostgreSQL, RAG, AI agents, memory management, and workflows in a single PostgreSQL-native stack.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI platform</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">PostgreSQL</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">RAG</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • May 27, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.zero.xyz\" target=\"_blank\">zero.xyz</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Platform that gives AI agents instant access to over 8,000-9,000 tools, APIs and services without requiring individual API keys or account configurations.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agent tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">APIs</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">infrastructure</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • May 27, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/tabstack\" target=\"_blank\">Tabstack Web Research</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">API service that runs autonomous research agents with cited answers in a single API call, enabling web data extraction and browser automation without scrapers.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">research agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">API</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">automation</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • Jun 1, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/mistral-vibe\" target=\"_blank\">Mistral Vibe</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">AI agent designed for long-running, multi-step work and coding tasks, built by Mistral AI as part of their agent tooling ecosystem for autonomous development workflows.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Mistral AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • Jun 1, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/calling-skills-for-ai-agents\" target=\"_blank\">Calling Skills for AI Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n    